{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48980","headline":"庐山瀑布 · 孙鲂","name":"庐山瀑布","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有山来便有，万丈落云端。\n雾喷千岩湿，雷倾九夏寒。\n图中僧写去，湖上客回看。\n却羡爲猨鹤，飞鸣近碧湍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙鲂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}